# Runs Orchestrator.select_action(engine_id, action_id, params) to
# completion, streaming Progress as feedback and Intent-delegation
# transitions implicitly (the node still forwards delegate progress on this
# same feedback channel, tagged via Progress.phase/message).

string engine_id
string action_id
string params_json
---
rammp_orchestrator_interfaces/Result result
---
rammp_orchestrator_interfaces/Progress progress
